      "label": "Obama and Clinton Political Context",
      "description": "The meme is constructed using the real-world political context of Barack Obama and Hillary Clinton, who were both prominent figures in U.S. politics during the 2008 and 2016 elections. The image is taken from a moment where Clinton was speaking, and the meme implies a political accusation or blame-shifting dynamic between them. This context is necessary to understand the meme’s intent, which is to suggest a false narrative of blame and racial deflection.",
